{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"16ded5dc4e2ddb729010e3886586b1a875952506b8d309b0047c2ac2b798eef4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":51,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["再审判巴比伦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华如此说：",{"text":"我必使毁灭的风刮起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击巴比伦和住在立加米的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打发外邦人来到巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"簸扬她，使她的地空虚。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在她遭祸的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要周围攻击她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拉弓的，要向拉弓的和贯甲挺身的射箭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要怜惜她的少年人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要灭尽她的全军。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必在迦勒底人之地被杀仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在巴比伦的街上被刺透。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列和犹大虽然境内充满违背以色列圣者的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却没有被他的 神—万军之耶和华丢弃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"你们要从巴比伦中逃奔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各救自己的性命！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要陷在她的罪孽中一同灭亡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这是耶和华报仇的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必向巴比伦施行报应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦素来是耶和华手中的金杯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使天下沉醉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万国喝了她的酒就颠狂了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦忽然倾覆毁坏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要为她哀号；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为止她的疼痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿乳香或者可以治好。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们想医治巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她却没有治好。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"离开她吧！我们各人归回本国；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为她受的审判通于上天，达到穹苍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经彰显我们的公义。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"来吧！我们可以在锡安","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报告耶和华—我们 神的作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"你们要磨尖了箭头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"抓住盾牌。","poem":1},"耶和华定意攻击巴比伦，将她毁灭，所以激动了米底亚君王的心；因这是耶和华报仇，就是为自己的殿报仇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你们要竖立大旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻击巴比伦的城墙；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要坚固了望台，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派定守望的设下埋伏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华指着巴比伦居民所说的话、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所定的意，他已经作成。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在众水之上多有财宝的啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的结局到了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你贪婪之量满了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华指着自己起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使敌人充满你，像蚂蚱一样；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必呐喊攻击你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["颂赞 神的诗歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和华用能力创造大地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用智慧建立世界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用聪明铺张穹苍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他一发声，空中便有多水激动；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他使云雾从地极上腾。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他造电随雨而闪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从他府库中带出风来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人都成了畜类，毫无知识。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各银匠都因他的偶像羞愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所铸的偶像本是虚假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中并无气息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是虚无的，是迷惑人的工作，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到追讨的时候，必被除灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的分不像这些，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他是造作万有的主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列也是他产业的支派。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华是他的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华的铁锤"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你是我争战的斧子和打仗的兵器；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要用你打碎列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你毁灭列邦；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎马和骑马的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎战车和坐在其上的；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎男人和女人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎老年人和少年人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎壮丁和处女；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎牧人和他的群畜；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎农夫和他一对牛；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你打碎省长和副省长。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["惩罚巴比伦"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["耶和华说：「我必在你们眼前报复巴比伦人和迦勒底居民在锡安所行的诸恶。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你这行毁灭的山哪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是毁灭天下的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我与你反对。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必向你伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将你从山岩滚下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你成为烧毁的山。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人必不从你那里取石头为房角石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不取石头为根基石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必永远荒凉。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"要在境内竖立大旗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各国中吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列国预备攻击巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将亚拉腊、米尼、亚实基拿各国招来攻击她；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又派军长来攻击她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使马匹上来如蚂蚱，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列国和米底亚君王，与省长和副省长，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并他们所管全地之人，都预备攻击她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必震动而瘠苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和华向巴比伦所定的旨意成立了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使巴比伦之地荒凉，无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的勇士止息争战，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藏在坚垒之中。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的勇力衰尽，好像妇女一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的住处有火着起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"门闩都折断了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跑报的要彼此相遇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"送信的要互相迎接，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报告巴比伦王说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城的四方被攻取了，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渡口被占据了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"苇塘被火烧了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"兵丁也惊慌了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":["万军之耶和华—以色列的 神如此说：",{"text":"巴比伦","poem":1},{"noteId":66},{"text":"城好像踹谷的禾场；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再过片时，收割她的时候就到了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"以色列人说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦王尼布甲尼撒吞灭我，压碎我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我成为空虚的器皿。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他像大鱼将我吞下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我的美物充满他的肚腹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又将我赶出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"锡安的居民要说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦以强暴待我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"损害我的身体，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿这罪归给她。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷人要说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿流我们血的罪归到迦勒底的居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华要帮助以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"text":"所以，耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必为你伸冤，为你报仇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴比伦的海枯竭，使她的泉源干涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦必成为乱堆，为野狗的住处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"令人惊骇、嗤笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并且无人居住。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要像少壮狮子咆哮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像小狮子吼叫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们火热的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必为他们设摆酒席，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们沉醉，好叫他们快乐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"睡了长觉，永不醒起。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使他们像羊羔、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像公绵羊和公山羊下到宰杀之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦的命运"]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"text":"示沙克","poem":1},{"noteId":67},{"text":"何竟被攻取？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天下所称赞的何竟被占据？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦在列国中何竟变为荒场？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"海水涨起，漫过巴比伦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被许多海浪遮盖。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的城邑变为荒场、旱地、沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人居住，无人经过之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必刑罚巴比伦的彼勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他吐出所吞的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万民必不再流归他那里；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的城墙也必坍塌了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":[{"text":"我的民哪，你们要从其中出去！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人拯救自己，躲避耶和华的烈怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不要心惊胆怯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不要因境内所听见的风声惧怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这年有风声传来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那年也有风声传来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内有强暴的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"官长攻击官长。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":[{"text":"日子将到，我必刑罚巴比伦雕刻的偶像。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她全地必然抱愧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她被杀的人必在其中仆倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，天地和其中所有的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必因巴比伦欢呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为行毁灭的要从北方来到她那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦怎样使以色列被杀的人仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"照样她全地被杀的人也必在巴比伦仆倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["给在巴比伦的以色列人的信息"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":[{"text":"你们躲避刀剑的要快走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要站住！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在远方记念耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中追想耶路撒冷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们听见辱骂就蒙羞，满面惭愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为外邦人进入耶和华殿的圣所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子将到，我必刑罚巴比伦雕刻的偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"通国受伤的人必唉哼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":53,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦虽升到天上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽使她坚固的高处更坚固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"还有行毁灭的从我这里到她那里。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["巴比伦灭亡"]},{"type":"verse","number":54,"content":[{"text":"有哀号的声音从巴比伦出来；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有大毁灭的响声从迦勒底人之地发出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":55,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因耶和华使巴比伦变为荒场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使其中的大声灭绝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敌仿佛众水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"波浪匉訇，响声已经发出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":56,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是行毁灭的临到巴比伦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦的勇士被捉住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的弓折断了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华是施行报应的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必定施行报应。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":57,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王—名为万军之耶和华的说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴比伦的首领、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧人、省长、副省长，和勇士都沉醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们睡了长觉，永不醒起。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":58,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴比伦宽阔的城墙必全然倾倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她高大的城门必被火焚烧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"众民所劳碌的必致虚空；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国所劳碌的被火焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们都必困乏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米的信息传到巴比伦"]},{"type":"verse","number":59,"content":["犹大王西底家在位第四年，上巴比伦去的时候，玛西雅的孙子、尼利亚的儿子西莱雅与王同去（西莱雅是王宫的大臣），先知耶利米有话吩咐他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":60,"content":["耶利米将一切要临到巴比伦的灾祸，就是论到巴比伦的一切话，写在书上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":61,"content":["耶利米对西莱雅说：「你到了巴比伦务要念这书上的话；"]},{"type":"verse","number":62,"content":["又说：『耶和华啊，你曾论到这地方说：要剪除，甚至连人带牲畜没有在这里居住的，必永远荒凉。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":63,"content":["你念完了这书，就把一块石头拴在书上，扔在幼发拉底河中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":64,"content":["说：『巴比伦因耶和华所要降与她的灾祸，必如此沉下去，不再兴起，人民也必困乏。』」",{"text":"耶利米的话到此为止。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":66,"caller":"-","text":"原文是女子","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":33}},{"noteId":67,"caller":"-","text":"就是巴比伦","reference":{"chapter":51,"verse":41}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/51.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/52.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JER/50.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":64}